sometimes Dance Moms is more drama than  dancing but that ends when the camera  stopped rolling  usually Jojo C was known for being super  sweet but her claws come out in  defensive Abby Lee Miller some of these  stars just don't get along and Cameron  Bridges claims her experiences on the  show left her with serious PTSD famous  and soon-to-be former Dance Moms star  Abby Lee Miller is a controversial  figure to say the least  I think they need someone in their life  that is tough on them she fully admits  to pushing her students to be the best  they can be  it's just that some fans believe she  pushes them a little bit too far in fact  some of her former students have spoken  out against their former instructor and  made it clear they don't miss working  with her at all one of these former  students is dancer Brooke Hyland who let  her fans know that there's no love lost  between her and Abby Brooke posted a  now-deleted tik-tok video showing that  Facebook had suggested Abby as one of  her potential connections on the app in  response Brooke shook her head and  grimace making it clear this was one  Facebook friend she would not be adding  to her collection Brooke took the clip  down eventually but not before it was  spotted by Joe Josiah who was upset by  her reaction to their former instructor  Jojo commented that it's one thing not  to friend Abby on Facebook but another  to post a video about it Jojo such a  happy cheerful person that her comment  had to hurt it's no secret that Jojo and  Abby are quite close despite Abby's  legal issues and controversies with the  rest of the cast she excused Abby's  angry tirades by saying that she made  the cast of Dance Moms stars and that  the dancers should be grateful for her  help she also revealed that out of the  entire cast of Dance Moms  Abby is the person she keeps in contact  with the most Jojo feels bad that Abby  was hurt by a lot of people and says  she's sad most former Dance Moms stars  don't keep in touch with her anymore  in addition to standing up for Abby when  Brooke openly dismissed her Jojo has  gone out of her way to be there for her  friend when Abby was going through her  battle with cancer Jojo showed up at the  hospital with tons of snacks to share as  well as a $10,000 check from dancers  against cancer it's clear Jojo has  remain  loyal to Abby through the years but the  same can't be said for many of her  fellow dancers friendships often formed  quickly on Dance Moms  and it's not hard to see why these girls  spend long hours working together and  trying to deal with some seriously  stressful situations  Chloe Lucchesi AK and Maddie Ziegler  became fast friends while working  together on the show but unfortunately  they ran into some trouble when it came  to maintaining their friendship both  Maddie and Chloe have been super busy  and admit that they haven't been in  contact as much as they would have liked  Chloe has said that she had lost touch  with her former friend as well as the  rest of the Dance Moms cast  unfortunately we kind of fell out of  touch whenever I left and she left and  we all did our own thing  she said she'd grown apart from Maddie  as well as Brooke Hyland and Niazi AO  due to the fact that they were all  traveling so often I miss Maddie she's  she's really great and I'm really proud  of everything she's doing Chloe claims  competitions never got in the way of  their relationship but the distance  between them has been a lot harder to  look past maddie agrees that their  schedules kept them apart but also added  that things have changed between them  she also confessed to feeling sad about  the loss of their friendship and how  things have changed since her time on  the show meanwhile Maddie has managed to  stay in touch with many of her other  Dance Moms friends including Nia who  says she always has time to stay in  touch with her friends we all know the  moms love to argue amongst themselves on  the show but sometimes the dancers  aren't afraid to speak up when the  issues concern them  when Abby congratulated Kendall vertes  on her performance Ashlee Allen piped up  to point out that she believed her  daughter Brynn had superior dancing  skills Jill vertes fired back that that  was a totally inappropriate conversation  to have in front of their kids but  Ashlee refused to back down eventually  even Kendall spoke up in her own defense  demanding to know why are you so mean  later Kendall said Ashlee's behavior was  totally unacceptable and she's not  afraid to use her voice to call her out  our kids are becoming like their mothers  and is that really a good thing but  Ashlee's daughter Brynn had a different  reaction to Kendall's outburst as she  was reduced to tears over the  like I wish I could scream in her face  and say I mean she is the Kendall  defended her decision to go off on  Ashley now that I'm becoming older and  more mature I have a voice and I'm going  to use it even though Brynn called out  Kendall in defense of her mom ashley was  forced to reflect on her bad behavior  she admitted that she has no issue with  the other moms hating her but seeing  Kendall lose her cool like that was a  lot more difficult although this kind of  drama on the show is unheard of Brynn  didn't let it go when someone made a  crude comment about the team's outfits  on social media Brynn liked the comment  causing some fans to accuse her of being  shady with the exception of Jojo CY it  seems like a lot of her former students  aren't interested in maintaining a  relationship with their former  instructor Abby Lee Miller one of these  students is Maddie Ziegler who became  famous after appearing on the show  during an interview with Us Weekly  Maddie admitted that she doesn't keep in  contact with Abby although she said she  wishes her the best she has no desire to  be part of her life again according to  Abby she felt like a mother figure to  Maddie and her sister Mackenzie and was  devastated when they cut her out of  their lives  Abby wishes she could have been a part  of their massive post-show success and  is disappointed in the way things worked  out between them she claims that without  her hard work and studio time Maddie and  Mackenzie wouldn't be where they are  today during her a significant legal  issues Abby called out her former  students for trying to distance  themselves from her except for Jojo of  course Abby said she's proud of Jojo  firs staying in touch and that pretty  much everyone else might as well have  forgotten her name and it turns out her  star pupil agrees both Maddie and  Mackenzie Oh at least some with her  success to Abby there was a time on  Dance Moms when sisters Paige and Brooke  Hyland were friendly with the rest of  the cast but since they left things  haven't been pretty to say the least we  talked about some of the issues Abby Lee  Miller has with her former students and  how she feels as though they abandoned  her after she helped them with their  careers but things between PA Thailand  and Abby Lee Miller crossed the line  from verbal altercations to a serious  incident during one heated confrontation  between Abby and Paige Abby threw a  chair causing Paige to fear for her own  safety or at least that's what her  lawsuit claimed according to her lawyer  Paige had seen Abby physically engaged  with other members of the cast and was  afraid of things getting worse between  them she filed a five million dollar  lawsuit against Collins Avenue  entertainment for putting her in the  position in the first place and another  suit against Abby for emotional distress  ultimately the emotional distress  charges were dropped but this clearly  didn't improve things between Abby and  Paige no wonder Brooke didn't want to  add her as a friend on Facebook  according to Paige she suffered from  anxiety and panic attacks since her time  on Dance Moms because of her experiences  with Abby  according to Dance Moms star Liliana  catchman she's come up with a great  strategy to deal with all of the mom  drama without letting it affect her  dance routines  I got noise-canceling headphones  whenever the moms have any drama that  involves me I just put on my  noise-canceling headphones and just  focus on the dance even though she  admits it can be stressful whether or  not she can hear them Lilly says she's  motivated by wanting to prove the haters  wrong and show off just how good of a  dancer she really is but while this star  has worked hard to tune out the  over-the-top moms there's one cast  member she has a much harder time not  getting upset by Lilly and Brady Farrar  definitely aren't enemies but she admits  they get on each other's nerves from  time to time she compared their  relationship to that of a brother and  sister and if you have a sibling  yourself you probably know exactly what  that means  according to Lilly Brady can't resist  antagonizing her and no pair of  headphones in existence can tune him out  one of his favorite tricks is taking up  way too much space on the bus when they  travel together and poking her whenever  he can get close enough to do so Eliana  is a dancer who's not afraid to smell  the tea about what it was really like  behind the scenes of Dance Moms she's  the first to admit that some of the  things we saw on television didn't  exactly play out that way behind the  scenes it's highly produced and she  pointed out that something as simple as  an eye roll could be put into a scene to  make it look like a dancer  frustrated with one of their peers  instead of expressing their displeasure  about something else entirely  Eliana says the show stopped short of  handing them scripts but with the right  editing techniques they can change the  narrative to make it seem much more  dramatic and according to Eliana one of  the things the show really wanted to  promote was a supposed feud between her  and fellow Dance Moms star Giannina  apparently it took some time for Eliana  to get the proper permit for appearance  on season 8 although it was just a  paperwork mix-up that's not what it  seemed like on the show cuz they were  both saying that like Giannina like took  me away from everybody while these two  may not be besties both Eliana and  Giannina seem to agree their issues look  way more overblown on the show what do  you think about all of the Dance Moms  drama out there be honest is it why you  tuned into the show or do you just love  watching the competitions share your  thoughts on this situation with us and  your fellow Dance Moms fans in the  comments section below and don't forget  to click subscribe for more videos from  us here at the things thanks for  watching we'll see you again next time
 

